{"id":"gamefreak-lineblog-2540602","kind":"blog","title":"【日记】2016八丈岛邂逅小麂","display_title":null,"dek":null,"date":"2016-04-04","publication":"増田順一 公式ブログ · キョン！","issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi"}],"works":[],"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-director/lineblog-2540602/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"cover":null,"archive_type":"gamefreak_masuda_lineblog","summary":"记录在八丈岛参加花卉节、终于见到儿时漫画里小麂，并因航班停飞提前返程的难忘一天。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"tags":["Game Freak","增田顺一","LINE BLOG"],"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","source":{"title":"増田順一 公式ブログ · キョン！","url":"https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/2540602.html","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160405165245id_/https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/2540602.html","type":"official_blog_wayback"},"body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"八丈岛\n紫茉莉节最终日！\n<br>\n从早上开始\n皮卡丘就活力满满！\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2540602/001-7d0f253bb3.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2540602/001-7d0f253bb3.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n然后\n离开会场去观光！\n<br>\n<br>\n说到八丈岛……\n<br>\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2540602/002-e19b31ece6.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2540602/002-e19b31ece6.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"1136\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n和招牌上相同的……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n游乐设施广场！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n才不是（笑）\n是小麂！！\n小麂！！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n终于见到你了！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2540602/003-eab848b0d1.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2540602/003-eab848b0d1.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n好小！\n是小麂宝宝？！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2540602/004-031714b733.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2540602/004-031714b733.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"1136\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n咦？\n大家都好小！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n原来小麂\n这么小啊！\n\n<br>\n\n\n我还擅自想象成\n鹿那么大（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n八丈岛的小麂！\n终于见到你了！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2540602/005-9ea4f19f93.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2540602/005-9ea4f19f93.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n好可爱……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n小时候\n我从一部叫《Gaki Deka》的漫画里知道了\n八丈岛的小麂\n\n<br>\n\n\n终于见到你了！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n和从东京\n专程来制作皮卡丘的\n宝可梦粉丝们一起\n合影留念！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2540602/006-850d3fd10e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2540602/006-850d3fd10e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n大家\n谢谢你们！！\n能一起看小麂\n会是一生的回忆哦！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n就在这时\n我收到了一封邮件。\n\n<br>\n\n\n明天早上返回羽田的第一班航班\n很有可能会停飞！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n什么？！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n结果发现只剩下立刻返程的航班\n取消了一天的住宿\n急忙赶往机场！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n紫茉莉节的\n闭幕活动\n没能参加，真遗憾！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n一个人前往机场\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2540602/007-9fe3d4e226.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2540602/007-9fe3d4e226.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"1136\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n            飞机晚点了\n一直没有起飞，不过……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n从机内向外看时\n竟然发现了\n正在挥手的人们！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n和我一起看小麂的\n大家\n挥手为我送行！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2540602/008-b60b8705c1.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2540602/008-b60b8705c1.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n光看照片看不出来吧（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n这是从送行那一边拍的照片\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2540602/009-fe5810d13d.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2540602/009-fe5810d13d.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"806\"></a></figure>\n\n（增田乘坐的全日空）\n\n<br>\n\n\n大家，谢谢你们啊！！\n我们下次再见！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n这次的花毯活动\n\n<br>\n\n\n充满了回忆\n成为了一段美好又幸福的\n时光！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n八丈岛的大家！\n\n又会来玩的！！\n\n谢谢你们！！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n（附赠）\n想进一步了解小麂的朋友\n请看这里！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2540602/010-d91eec15ac.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2540602/010-d91eec15ac.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>","markdown_ja":"八丈島\nフリージアまつり最終日！\n<br>\n朝から\n元気いっぱいのピカチュウ！\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2540602/001-7d0f253bb3.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2540602/001-7d0f253bb3.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\nそして\n会場を後に観光へ！\n<br>\n<br>\n八丈島といえば・・\n<br>\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2540602/002-e19b31ece6.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2540602/002-e19b31ece6.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"1136\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n看板で共通の・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n遊具広場！！\n\n<br>\n\n\nじゃないよ（笑）\nキョンだよ！！\nキョン！！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nついに会えた！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2540602/003-eab848b0d1.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2540602/003-eab848b0d1.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nちっちゃ！\n子供のキョン？！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2540602/004-031714b733.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2540602/004-031714b733.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"1136\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nあれ？\nみんな小さい！！\n\n<br>\n\n\nキョンって\n小さかったんだ！\n\n<br>\n\n\n鹿ぐらいと\n勝手にイメージしてた（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n八丈島のキョン！\nやっと会えたね！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2540602/005-9ea4f19f93.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2540602/005-9ea4f19f93.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nかわいい・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n子供の頃\nがきデカ という漫画で知った\n八丈島のキョン\n\n<br>\n\n\nついに会えました！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n東京から\nピカチュウを作りに来てくれた\nポケモンファンと一緒に\n記念撮影！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2540602/006-850d3fd10e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2540602/006-850d3fd10e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nみんな\nありがとう！！\n一緒にキョン見れたのは\n一生の思い出だよ！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそしてこの時\nメールが届きました。\n\n<br>\n\n\n明日 羽田に戻る朝1便が\n欠航の可能性大！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nええ？！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nすぐに帰る便しかないことが判明\n宿を1日キャンセルして\n急いで空港へ！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nフリージアまつりの\nクローズイベントに\n参加できず残念！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nひとり空港へ\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2540602/007-9fe3d4e226.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2540602/007-9fe3d4e226.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"1136\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n            飛行機遅れて\nなかなか離陸しなかったけど・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n機内から外を見ると\nなんと\n手を振る人たちを発見！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n一緒にキョンを見た\nみんなが\n手を振って見送ってくれてました！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2540602/008-b60b8705c1.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2540602/008-b60b8705c1.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n写真だと分からないか（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n見送ってくれた側の写真がこちら\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2540602/009-fe5810d13d.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2540602/009-fe5810d13d.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"806\"></a></figure>\n\n\n（マスダが乗ってるANA）\n\n<br>\n\n\nみんな ありがとうね！！\nまた会いましょう！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n今回の\nインフィオラータ\n\n<br>\n\n\n思い出いっぱい\n素敵で\n幸せな\n時間になりました！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n八丈島のみなさん！\n\nまた遊びに来ます！！\n\nありがとうございました！！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n（オマケ）\nキョンをもっと知りたい方は\nこちらをどうぞ！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2540602/010-d91eec15ac.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2540602/010-d91eec15ac.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>"}}